ion?｜5. 关于男士，女士在其介绍中说了什么？\n[06:19.14]6. What has motivated the man to write his books?｜6. 是什么促使男士去写书？\n[06:37.61]7. Who does the man say his last book was mainly written for?｜7. 男士说他的上一部书主要是为谁写的？\n[06:55.45]8. What does the man recommend people do?｜8. 男士建议人们做什么？', NOW(), NOW()
